 ks by Bartók\, Bach\, and Fulmer\, among others\, have received internat
 ional acclaim. Kapustin was the first violinist of the renowned Rubens Qu
 artet from 2008 until the group's final season in 2016. Kapustin earned a
  master's degree in violin performance from The Juilliard School with Rob
