 and Northwestern Universities\, and studied with Menahem Pressler and Urs
 ula Oppens. A dedicated pedagogue\, Choi is also in demand as a master cl
 ass clinician and conference presenter\, sharing insights on phrasing\, t
 echnique\, and interpretation.</p> Meeting URL: https://liveatjacobs.musi
 c.indiana.edu/
